.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-key\-subkey\-export \- Export secret key material from the secret key store
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq key subkey export\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]  
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Export secret key material from the secret key store.
.PP
Exports the secret key material.  Note that even if secret key material is available, it may not be exportable.  For instance, secret key material stored on a hardware security module usually cannot be exported from the device.
.PP
The entire certificate is exported, but only the specified key's secret key material is exported.  An error is returned if the secret key material for the specified key is not available.
.PP
If you want to export all secret key material associated with a certificate, use `sq key export`.
.PP


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Subcommand options"
.TP
\fB\-\-cert\fR=\fIFINGERPRINT|KEYID\fR
Use certificates with the specified fingerprint or key ID
.TP
\fB\-\-cert\-email\fR=\fIEMAIL\fR
Use certificates where a user ID includes the specified email address
.TP
\fB\-\-cert\-userid\fR=\fIUSERID\fR
Use certificates with the specified user ID
.TP
\fB\-\-key\fR=\fIFINGERPRINT|KEYID\fR
Export the secret key material for the specified primary key or subkey
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR=\fIFILE\fR
Write to FILE or stdout if omitted
.IP
[default: \fB\-\fR]
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
Export Alice's signing\-capable and encryption\-capable subkeys, but not
her primary key or her authentication\-capable subkey.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq key subkey export \\
.RE
.RS
.RS
\-\-cert=EB28F26E2739A4870ECC47726F0073F60FD0CBF0 \\
.RE
.RE
.RS
.RS
\-\-key=42020B87D51877E5AF8D272124F3955B0B8DECC8 \\
.RE
.RE
.RS
.RS
\-\-key=74DCDEAF17D9B995679EB52BA6E65EA2C8497728
.RE
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-key\fR(1), \fBsq\-key\-subkey\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
